## 📁 Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/              # Next.js App Router pages
├── components/       # Shared components
│   ├── ui/          # Base UI components
│   └── features/    # Feature-specific components
├── hooks/           # Custom React hooks
├── lib/             # Utilities, helpers
├── types/           # TypeScript type definitions
└── styles/          # Global styles
```

---

## 🔐 Security

- Validate input ở cả frontend VÀ backend
- Sử dụng parameterized queries (Prisma)
- CORS configured đúng
- Rate limiting cho sensitive endpoints
- HTTPS only trong production

---

## 📖 Documentation

- JSDoc cho functions phức tạp
- README.md up-to-date
- CHANGELOG.md cho changes quan trọng
- API documentation (docs/api/)

